        "highlight_3TrRMy": {
          "type": "highlight",
          "settings": {
            "media_highlight_bg_color": "#121212",
            "title": "THE LATEST EPISODE OF SEASON 8",
            "title_color": "#ffffff",
            "media_highlight_alignment": "left",
            "media_highlight_description": "<p>Violent But True is back with a story about grit, violence, and sheer stubbornness, forget Hollywood. The real blockbuster went down in Afghanistan, October 2009. The Battle of Kamdesh wasn’t supposed to be survivable. But it was. Because Romesha was there. </p><h4><strong>Violent But True Season 8 Bastards of War: Forgotten Front</strong></h4><p>The Global War on Terror made legends. But not all of them made it home or onto History Channel. They don’t write songs about these service members. So we tell their stories in the dark... where they belong.</p>",
            "media_highlight_description_color": "#ffffff",
            "media_highlight_cta_text": "PLAY THE VIOLENCE",
