            "yts_video_title": "",
            "yts_description": "<strong>Episode 9: </strong>Violent But True is back with a story about grit, violence, and sheer stubbornness, forget Hollywood. The real blockbuster went down in Afghanistan, October 2009. The Battle of Kamdesh wasn’t supposed to be survivable. But it was. Because Romesha was there.",
